--- a/docs/build/autogenerate.rst
+++ b/docs/build/autogenerate.rst
@@ -125,6 +125,9 @@ Autogenerate **will detect**:
 * Change of nullable status on columns.
 * Basic changes in indexes and explicitly-named unique constraints
